            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n0\nRecommended\nApr 2022\nReal Vietnamese street food, or so they say.........who knows............\nLow seating, and a nice colorful decor....... started off ordering some tanks of beer..........\nMy friend who recommended this place, arrived and so we got into the food -- ordering a lot of small meaty dishes...... don't ask me what they were all, but they all tasted fantastic and well delicious, and went down very well with the beers........\nHad a good bit of beer I must say, and the food was very good, all in all we had a great time.........spending a few hours chillin away as the night encroached.......... \nBill wasn't too bad, as far as I can remember, all very affordable and not as pricey as down town.........\nRecommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 5, 2022",
