            "review_text": "Robert R\nBangkok, Thailand35 contributions\n0\n100% Vietnam. This is NOT for someone who is \"fancy\"\nJan 2019 • Couples\nThis is real, local, actual Vietnamese food. It's not street food but it might be close? Don't expect Applebees or equivalent. The sets are small for anyone who is not Asian and the place has a very \"lived in\" look and feel. However, I never judge a book by it's cover and the \"when in Rome\" phrase applies here. This place was always busy when I walked by so I finally went in one night. The food was delicious, all of it. The goat, snail soup and etc. 100% recommend at least if you're not a snob.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 13, 2019",
