            "review_text": "Adair_and_Thando\nNew York City, New York119 contributions\n0\nA local spot definitely worth a visit!\nApr 2018 • Friends\nIf you’re looking to eat like a true Saigonese, this is the place! A local spot near downtown, the open front and tables on the street allow for great people watching in the company of Saigon locals. The food is delicious and unique, bursting with flavor. We would recommend the fried sticky rice appetizer and the beef hot pot with passion fruit. It is one of the tastiest things we ate in HCMC!!\nRead more\nWritten April 30, 2018",
